  description: '1 "Dracotail" monster + 1 monster in the hand

    You can target
    2 "Dracotail" cards in your GY and 1 face-up card on the field with the same
    type (Monster, Spell, or Trap) as 1 of those GY cards; shuffle all 3 into the
    Deck. If 2 or more monsters are sent to the GY at the same time, while this card
    is in your GY (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card,
    but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only use each effect of "Dracotail
    Shaulas" once per turn.'
